  {
   "id": "b78",
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "heading_path": [
    "Accordion"
   ],
   "text": "Displays collapsible content panels for presenting information in a limited amount of space"
  },
  {
   "id": "b79",
   "kind": "paragraph",
   "heading_path": [
    "Accordion"
   ],
   "text": "The accordion component builds on top of the collapse directive to provide a list of items, with collapsible bodies that are collapsed or expanded by clicking on the item's header."
  },
